name: line-world-mermaid
description: Produces native Mermaid diagrams specifically for clean Line World videos, with neutral line surfaces, metadata, semantic IDs and parent-controlled motion. Use for process, schema, interaction, hierarchy, timeline and flow notation inside the video plugin.
